    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40300" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπινέμ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>appropriate apportioning</i> of medical treatment, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Praec.</u>
				8
			</span></i>; of a bandage, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπινομή</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).775
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. (from 
				Med.
			) <i>spreading</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2p.40U.
			</span></i>; of disease, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				50.8.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>.
			= Lat. <i>indictio,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12(9).907.4
			</span></i> (Chalcis, <span class="entity">iv A.D.</span>), prob. in ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.24
			</span></i> (Megara, <span class="entity">v A.D.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mens.</u>
				3.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cod.Just.</u>
				10.16.13.5
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
